@startuml SIPAM_Deployment_Diagram

!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #F5F2EA

title SIPAM-USCO — Deployment Diagram (AWS EC2 + IoT)

node "Users" as Users {
    artifact "Web Browser" as Browser
}

node "IoT Field Device" as IoTDevice #4A90D9 {
    artifact "ESP32 DevKit V1" as ESP32
    artifact "NEO-6M GPS Module" as GPS
    artifact "WiFi 802.11 b/g/n" as WiFi
}

cloud "Internet" as Internet

node "GitHub.com" as GitHub {
    artifact "SIPAM Repository\n(main branch)" as Repo
}

node "AWS Cloud (us-east-2)" as AWS {

    node "EC2 Instance\nt2.micro | Ubuntu 22.04 LTS" as EC2 {
        note right
          IP: 18.222.152.152
          vCPU: 1 | RAM: 1 GB
          SSD: 29 GB
          DNS: ec2-18-222-152-152
               .us-east-2.compute.amazonaws.com
        end note

        node "Docker Engine 24.x\nDocker Compose v2" as Docker {

            rectangle "frontend\n[Nginx:alpine + React Build]" #E8F5E9 {
                [Nginx :80] as Nginx
                artifact "React Static Files" as ReactBuild
            }

            rectangle "backend\n[python:3.11-slim]" #FFEBEE {
                [FastAPI/Uvicorn :8000] as FastAPI
                artifact "Routers: auth, convocatorias,\npostulaciones, iot, ocr, nlp" as Routers
            }

            rectangle "ai_service\n[python:3.11-slim (stub)]" #F3E5F5 {
                [Flask :5001] as Flask
                artifact "app_stub.py\n(course-compliant)" as StubApp
            }

            rectangle "db\n[postgres:16-alpine]" #E3F2FD {
                [PostgreSQL :5432] as Postgres
                database "Volume: postgres_data" as PGVol
            }

        }

        rectangle "AWS Security Group" {
            artifact "Port 22 (SSH): Admin only" as P22
            artifact "Port 80 (HTTP): 0.0.0.0/0" as P80
        }
    }

}

' ===== CONNECTIONS =====

Users --> Internet : HTTP
IoTDevice --> Internet : WiFi HTTP POST\n(iot_device_key_12345)
Internet --> Nginx : :80 → 18.222.152.152

Nginx --> FastAPI : /api/v1/* (reverse proxy)
FastAPI --> Postgres : SQLAlchemy ORM
FastAPI --> Flask : HTTP /predict\n/ocr/extract\n/analyze_letter

Postgres --> PGVol : persistence
Flask --> StubApp

GitHub --> Docker : git pull &&\ndocker compose up -d --build

note bottom of IoTDevice
  Hardware: ESP32 + NEO-6M
  Firmware: Arduino C++
  Protocol: HTTP/1.1 REST
  Auth: X-Api-Key header
  Interval: POST every 60s
  Fields: lat, lng, alt, sats,
          battery, rssi, speed
end note

note bottom of Flask
  Stub mode deployed (AWS disk constraints)
  Returns course-compliant JSON responses
  CNN OCR: Conv2D architecture metadata
  NLP: DistilBERT architecture metadata
  Full model: available locally
end note

note right of FastAPI
  Endpoints:
  /api/v1/auth/
  /api/v1/convocatorias/
  /api/v1/postulaciones/
  /api/v1/iot/          (NEW)
  /api/v1/ocr/          (NEW)
  /api/v1/nlp/          (NEW)
  /docs (Swagger UI)
end note

@enduml
